---
// Copy: .ai/deliverables/redo-copy-en.md (v3, gated). Equivalent page on huanqiao.gesedge.com: /audit/.
// ponytail: "Sample report" button hidden until Kenny's sample audit exists.
import Page from '../../shared/layouts/Page.astro';
import { HOST, HQ } from '../../shared/site';
---
<Page
  title="Website review for Chinese exporters · 成都寰桥"
  description="Your factory's website, and how AI assistants describe your company, reviewed from a US buyer's point of view. ¥2,980."
  path="/exporters/"
  alt="/audit/"
>
  <div class="wrap head">
    <h1 class="display h1">Your factory’s website, reviewed from a US buyer’s point of view.</h1>
    <p class="muted">For export managers at Chinese factories. Our sister company in Chengdu, <span lang="zh-CN">成都寰桥</span>, reviews your website and checks how AI assistants describe your company.</p>
    <p class="ctas"><a class="btn" href={HOST.zh + '/audit/'} hreflang="zh-CN">Chinese version for your boss →</a></p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <h2 class="label s-4">What you get</h2>
      <ul class="s-8 list">
        <li>Notes on each page from a buyer’s point of view.</li>
        <li>An AI snapshot: five buyer questions put to ChatGPT, Gemini, and Perplexity, three times each, with dated screenshots.</li>
        <li>A list of fixes in priority order.</li>
        <li>The report in English and Chinese, with a short video walkthrough.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <h2 class="label s-4">Price</h2>
      <p class="s-8 price">¥2,980, five working days. The full fee is credited to a website build ordered within 60 days.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <h2 class="label s-4">How it works</h2>
      <div class="s-8">
        <p>Add us on WeCom, then a free 15-minute call, then the contract and fapiao. The report is due five working days after that.</p>
        <p class="muted">We don’t promise inquiries, search rankings, or mentions by AI assistants.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <h2 class="label s-4">Company</h2>
      <p class="s-8"><span lang="zh-CN">{HQ.name}</span> · Unified Social Credit Code {HQ.uscc} · Issues fapiao.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  .head { padding-top: 56px; padding-bottom: 48px; }
  .head p { margin-top: 20px; }
  .ctas { margin-top: 28px; }
  .list { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.1em; }
  .list li { margin-bottom: 0.6em; }
  .price { color: var(--celadon); }
</style>
